    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most entertaining and challenging Clutter yet with over 1800 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest variation you won't want to miss are the Block Puzzles &amp; Split Takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/e8d8d1370cd1d50e801450cedd387bcb.poster.avif?t=1751556984\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/e8d8d1370cd1d50e801450cedd387bcb.webm?t=1751556984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And just like regular Clutter levels, they are highly  addicting too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And wait until you see the new Variation on Pop-Ups and Clutter Pics (Holes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've never seen Clutter this challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As always, Favorites allow you to collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/3bbddca0d6a1f181a2b694f06bd72dfc.avif?t=1751556984\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1800 levels including a very challenging 100 level Main Quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra easy No-Motion Old-School area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All new Block Puzzles and Split Takes that you won't believe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of picture puzzles and 200 new Box Quotes puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joe's Favorite Music throughout the game with a Cinematic Feel</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most entertaining and challenging Clutter yet with over 1800 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest variation you won't want to miss are the Block Puzzles &amp; Split Takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/e8d8d1370cd1d50e801450cedd387bcb.poster.avif?t=1751556984\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/e8d8d1370cd1d50e801450cedd387bcb.webm?t=1751556984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And just like regular Clutter levels, they are highly  addicting too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And wait until you see the new Variation on Pop-Ups and Clutter Pics (Holes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've never seen Clutter this challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As always, Favorites allow you to collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684320/extras/3bbddca0d6a1f181a2b694f06bd72dfc.avif?t=1751556984\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1800 levels including a very challenging 100 level Main Quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra easy No-Motion Old-School area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All new Block Puzzles and Split Takes that you won't believe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of picture puzzles and 200 new Box Quotes puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joe's Favorite Music throughout the game with a Cinematic Feel</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Are you ready for Joe's Ultimate Challenge? Take on new block puzzles and split takes among over 1800 puzzles that promise to keep you playing for days and days. Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability!",
